    "text": "NBC Connecticut\nwebsite\nTolland\nFormer Tolland man accused in life insurance scheme impacting at least 9 people: police\nBy Angela Fortuna,\n7 hours agoA former Tolland man is accused in a life insurance scheme that police say defrauded nine people in Connecticut and additional states. State police arrested 34-year-old Ian Pierce, who now lives in Epping, New Hampshire, on July 24. The Statewide Organized Crime Investigative Task Force launched an investigation into Pierce...\n1",
